in?return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fessssam.itch.io%2Fpixel-ae&amp;intent=community"><svg class="svgicon icon_vote_down" role="img" width="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden version="1.1" height="20"><polygon points="2 6 12 18 22 6" /></svg></a></div><a class="avatar_container" href="https://itch.io/profile/sproutkid"><div class="post_avatar" style="background-image: url(https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI1MDM5MDc0LnBuZw==/25x25%23/pm8hiI.png)"></div></a><div class="post_header"><span class="post_author"><a href="https://itch.io/profile/sproutkid">Joshington</a></span><span class="post_date" title="2026-02-20 16:49:00"><a href="https://itch.io/post/15516154">24 days ago</a></span><span class="vote_counts"></span></div><div class="post_content"><div class="post_body user_formatted" dir="auto"><p>Hey!&nbsp;Just to let you know, I&#x27;m going to be using the Pixel&nbsp;AE-Bold font for another 2D platformer I&#x27;m working on in Godot 4.6, Super Clover World. Thanks again for this asset pack!</p></div><div class="post_footer"><a class="post_action reply_btn" data-register_action="community_reply" href="https://itch.io/login?return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fessssam.itch.io%2Fpixel-ae&amp;intent=community">Reply</a></div></div></div></div><div class="community_post_replies top_level_replies"><div id="post-15516477" class="community_post has_vote_column is_reply" data-post="{&quot;id&quot;:15516477,&quot;user_id&quot;:2075286}"><div class="post_grid"><div class="post_votes"><a class="vote_up_btn vote_btn" data-register_action="community_vote" title="Vote up" href="https://itch.io/login?return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fessssam.itch.io%2Fpixel-ae&amp;intent=community"><svg class="svgicon icon_vote_up" role="img" width="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden version="1.1" height="20"><polygon points="2 18 12 6 22 18" /></svg></a> <a class="vote_down_btn vote_btn" data-register_action="community_vote" title="Vote down" href="https://itch.io/login?return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fessssam.itch.io%2Fpixel-ae&amp;intent=community"><svg class="svgicon icon_vote_down" role="img" width="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden version="1.1" height="20"><polygon points="2 6 12 18 22 6" /></svg></a></div><a class="avatar_container" href="https://itch.io/profile/essssam"><div class="post_avatar" style="background-image: url(https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzEwMTUyMzMxLnBuZw==/25x25%23/4jb5aI.png)"></div></a><div class="post_header"><span class="post_author"><a href="https://itch.io/profile/essssam">Essssam</a></span><span class="post_date" title="2026-02-20 17:51:23"><a href="https://itch.io/post/15516477">23 days ago</a></span><span class="vote_counts"></span></div><div class="post_content"><div class="post_body user_formatted" dir="auto"><p>Good luck with development, Joshington!</p></div><div class="post_footer"><a class="post_action reply_btn" data-register_action="community_reply" href="https://itch.io/login?return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fessssam.itch.io%2Fpixel-ae&amp;intent=community">Reply</a></div></div></div></div></div><div id="post-15090378" class="community_post has_vote_column has_replies" data-post="{&quot;id&quot;:15090378,&quot;user_id&quot;:11955766}"><div class="post_grid"><div class="post_votes"><a class="vote_up_btn vote_btn" data-register_action="community_vote" title="Vote up" href="https://itch.io/login?return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fessssam.itch.io%2Fpixel-ae&amp;intent=community"><svg class="svgicon icon_vote_up" role="img" width="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden version="1.1" height="20"><polygon points="2 18 12 6 22 18" /></svg></a> <a class="vote_down_btn vote_btn" data-register_action="community_vote" title="Vote down" href="https://itch.io/login?return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fessssam.itch.io%2Fpixel-ae&amp;intent=community"><svg class="svgicon icon_vote_down" role="img" width="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden version="1.1" height="20"><polygon points="2 6 12 18 22 6" /></svg></a></div><a class="avatar_container" href="https://itch.io/profile/sproutkid"><div class="post_avatar" style="background-image: url(https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI1MDM5MDc0LnBuZw==/25x25%23/pm8hiI.png)"></div></a><div class="post_header"><span class="post_author"><a href="https://itch.io/profile/sproutkid">Joshington</a></span><span class="post_date" title="2025-12-19 21:12:24"><a href="https://itch.io/post/15090378">86 days ago</a></span><span class="vote_counts"></span></div><div class="post_content"><div class="post_body user_formatted" dir="auto"><p>Hi&nbsp;Essssam! It&#x27;s me again! Just wanted to let you know, I&#x27;m going to use this font for my 2D&nbsp;platformer I&#x27;m currently working on in Godot 4.4, Platform Kid, because this is literally amazing craftmanship.&nbsp;Good luck making pixel art assets and wish me all the best on my project!</p></div><div class="post_footer"><a class="post_action reply_btn" data-register_action="community_reply" href="https://itch.io/login?return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fessssam.itch.io%2Fpixel-ae&amp;intent=community">Reply</a></div></div></div></div><div class="community_post_replies top_level_replies"><div id="post-15092745" class="community_post has_vote_column is_reply" data-post="{&quot;id&quot;:15092745,&quot;user_id&quot;:2075286}"><div class="post_grid"><div class="post_votes"><a class="vote_up_btn vote_btn" data-register_action="community_vote" title="Vote up" href="https://itch.io/login?return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fessssam.itch.io%2Fpixel-ae&amp;intent=community"><svg class="svgicon icon_vote_up" role="img" width="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden version="1.1" height="20"><polygon points="2 18 12 6 22 18" /></svg></a> <a class="vote_down_btn vote_btn" data-register_action="community_vote" title="Vote down" href="https://itch.io/login?return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fessssam.itch.io%2Fpixel-ae&amp;intent=community"><svg class="svgicon icon_vote_down" role="img" width="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden version="1.1" height="20"><polygon points="2 6 12 18 22 6" /></svg></a></div><a class="avatar_container" href="https://itch.io/profile/essssam"><div class="post_avatar" style="background-image: url(https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzEwMTUyMzMxLnBuZw==/25x25%23/4jb5aI.png)"></div></a><div class="post_header"><span class="post_author"><a href="https://itch.io/profile/essssam">Essssam</a></span><span class="post_date" title="2025-12-20 10:21:43"><a href="https://itch.io/post/15092745">86 days ago</a></span><span class="vote_counts"><span class="upvotes">(+1)</span></span></div><div class="post_content"><div class="post_body user_formatted" dir="auto"><p>Exciting! Good luck with the game.</p></div><div class="post_footer"><a class="post_action reply_btn" data-register_action="community_reply" href="https://itch.io/login?return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fessssam.itch.io%2Fpixel-ae&amp;intent=community">Reply</a></div></div></div></div></div><div id="post-15089298" class="community_post has_vote_column has_replies" data-post="{&quot;id&quot;:15089298,&quot;user_id&quot;:5508241}"><div class="post_grid"><div class="post_votes"><a class="vote_up_btn vote_btn" data-register_action="community_vote" title="Vote up" href="https://itch.io/login?return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fessssam.itch.io%2Fpixel-ae&amp;intent=community"><svg class="svgicon icon_vote_up" role="img" width="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden version="1.1" height="20"><polygon points="2 18 12 6 22 18" /></svg></a> <a class="vote_down_btn vote_btn" data-register_action="community_vote" title="Vote down" href="https://itch.io/login?return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fessssam.itch.io%2Fpixel-ae&amp;intent=community"><svg class="svgicon icon_vote_down" role="img" width="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden version="1.1" height="20"><polygon points="2 6 12 18 22 6" /></svg></a></div><a class="avatar_container" href="https://itch.io/profile/kurosawaran"><div class="post_avatar" style="background-image: url(/static/images/frog-cyan.png)"></div></a><div class="post_header"><span class="post_author"><a href="https://itch.io/profile/kurosawaran">KurosawaRan</a></span><span class="post_date" title="2025-12-19 17:20:46"><a href="https://itch.io/post/15089298">86 days ago</a></span><span class="vote_counts"></span></div><div class="post_content"><div class="post_body user_formatted" dir="auto"><p>The UI style on the cover is so interesting&mdash;what was it made with? Where can I find them?</p></div><div class="post_footer"><a class="post_action reply_btn" data-register_action="community_reply" href="https://itch.io/login?return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fessssam.itch.io%2Fpixel-ae&amp;intent=community">Reply</a></div></div></div></div><div class="community_post_replies top_level_replies"><div id="post-15092753" class="community_post has_vote_column is_reply has_replies" data-post="{&quot;id&quot;:15092753,&quot;user_id&quot;:2075286}"><div class="post_grid"><div class="post_votes"><a class="vote_up_btn vote_btn" data-register_action="community_vote" title="Vote up" href="https://itch.io/login?return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fessssam.itch.io%2Fpixel-ae&amp;intent=community"><svg class="svgicon icon_vote_up" role="img" width="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden version="1.1" height="20"><polygon points="2 18 12 6 22 18" /></svg></a> <a class="vote_down_btn vote_btn" data-register_action="community_vote" title="Vote down" href="https://itch.io/login?return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fessssam.itch.io%2Fpixel-ae&amp;intent=community"><svg class="svgicon icon_vote_down" role="img" width="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden version="1.1" height="20"><polygon points="2 6 12 18 22 6" /></svg></a></div><a class="avatar_container" href="https://itch.io/profile/essssam"><div class="post_avatar" style="background-image: url(https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzEwMTUyMzMxLnBuZw==/25x25%23/4jb5aI.png)"></div></a><div class="post_header"><span class="post_author"><a href="https://itch.io/profile/essssam">Essssam</a></span><span class="post_date" title="2025-12-20 10:25:24"><a href="https://itch.io/post/15092753">86 days ago</a></span><span class="vote_counts"></span></div><div class="post_content"><div class="post_body user_formatted" dir="auto"><p>The cover was put together either in Aseprite or Affinity Designer. It&nbsp;was made a few years back&nbsp;so I can&#x27;t quite remember which.&nbsp;</p></div><div class="post_footer"><a class="post_action reply_btn" data-register_action="community_reply" href="https://itch.io/login?return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fessssam.itch.io%2Fpixel-ae&amp;intent=community">Reply</a></div></div></div></div><div class="community_post_replies"><div id="post-15124388" class="community_post has_vote_column is_reply has_replies" data-post="{&quot;id&quot;:15124388,&quot;user_id&quot;:5508241}"><div class="post_grid"><div class="post_votes"><a class="vote_up_btn vote_btn" data-register_action="community_vote" title="Vote up" href="https://itch.io/login?return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fessssam.itch.io%2Fpixel-ae&amp;intent=community"><svg class="svgicon icon_vote_up" role="img" width="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden version="1.1" height="20"><polygon points="2 18 12 6 22 18" /></svg></a> <a class="vote_down_btn vote_btn" data-register_action="community_vote" title="Vote down" href="https://itch.io/login?return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fessssam.itch.io%2Fpixel-ae&amp;intent=community"><svg class="svgicon icon_vote_down" role="img" width="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden version="1.1" height="20"><polygon points="2 6 12 18 22 6" /></svg></a></div><a class="avatar_container" href="https://itch.io/profile/kurosawaran"><div class="post_avatar" style="background-image: url(/static/images/frog-cyan.png)"></div></a><div class="post_header"><span class="post_author"><a href="https://itch.io/profile/kurosawaran">KurosawaRan</a></span><span class="post_date" title="2025-12-24 12:54:18"><a href="https://itch.io/post/15124388">82 days ago</a></span><span class="vote_counts"></span></div><div class="post_content"><div class="post_body user_formatted" dir="auto"><p>Thank you for your reply. I&#x27;m a new streamer from China. I wanted to use a similar style interface in my livestream, so I tried to replicate it myself using drawing software. If you think this isn&#x27;t appropriate, I won&#x27;t continue using this interface.<img src="https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI0NzA0NzUzLnBuZw==/original/eGbwKz.png" loading="lazy"></p></div><div class="post_footer"><a class="post_action reply_btn" data-register_action="community_reply" href="https://itch.io/login?return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fessssam.itch.io%2Fpixel-ae&amp;intent=community">Reply</a></div></div></div></div><div class="community_post_replies"><div id="post-15124499" class="community_post has_vote_column is_reply has_replies" data-post="{&quot;id&quot;:15124499,&quot;user_id&quot;:2075286}"><div class="post_grid"><div class="post_votes"><a class="vote_up_btn vote_btn" data-register_action="community_vote" title="Vote up" href="https://itch.io/login?return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fessssam.itch.io%2Fpixel-ae&amp;intent=community"><svg class="svgicon icon_vote_up" role="img" width="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden version="1.1" height="20"><polygon points="2 18 12 6 22 18" /></svg></a> <a class="vote_down_btn vote_btn" data-register_action="community_vote" title="Vote down" href="https://itch.io/login?return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fessssam.itch.io%2Fpixel-ae&amp;intent=community"><svg class="svgicon icon_vote_down" role="img" width="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden version="1.1" height="20"><polygon points="2 6 12 18 22 6" /></svg></a></div><a class="avatar_container" href="https://itch.io/profile/essssam"><div class="post_avatar" style="background-image: url(https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzEwMTUyMzMxLnBuZw==/25x25%23/4jb5aI.png)"></div></a><div class="post_header"><span class="post_author"><a href="https://itch.io/profile/essssam">Essssam</a></span><span class="post_date" title="2025-12-24 13:23:31"><a href="https://itch.io/post/15124499">82 days ago</a></span><span class="vote_counts"></span></div><div class="post_content"><div class="post_body user_formatted" dir="auto"><p>This looks great! Feel free to use the font / style however you wish and good luck with streaming!</p></div><div class="post_footer"><a class="post_action reply_btn" data-register_action="community_reply" href="https://itch.io/login?return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fessssam.itch.io%2Fpixel-ae&amp;intent=community">Reply</a></div></div></div></div><div class="community_post_replies"><div id="post-15165692" class="community_post has_vote_column is_reply" data-post="{&quot;id&quot;:15165692,&quot;user_id&quot;:5508241}"><div class="post_grid"><div class="post_votes"><a class="vote_up_btn vote_btn" data-register_action="community_vote" title="Vote up" href="https://itch.io/login?return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fessssam.itch.io%2Fpixel-ae&amp;intent=community"><svg class="svgicon icon_vote_up" role="img" width="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden version="1.1" height="20"><polygon points="2 18 12 6 22 18" /></svg></a> <a class="vote_down_btn vote_btn" data-register_action="community_vote" title="Vote down" href="https://itch.io/login?return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fessssam.itch.io%2Fpixel-ae&amp;intent=community"><svg class="svgicon icon_vote_down" role="img" width="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden version="1.1" height="20"><polygon points="2 6 12 18 22 6" /></svg></a></div><a class="avatar_container" href="https://itch.io/profile/kurosawaran"><div class="post_avatar" style="background-image: url(/static/images/frog-cyan.png)"></div></a><div class="post_header"><span class="post_author"><a href="https://itch.io/profile/kurosawaran">KurosawaRan</a></span><span class="post_date" title="2025-12-30 19:15:09"><a href="https://itch.io/post/15165692">75 days ago</a></span><span class="vote_counts"></span></div><div class="post_content"><div class="post_body user_formatted" dir="auto"><p>Thank you very much, and I wish you smooth progress with your game development!</p></div><div class="post_footer"><a class="post_action reply_btn" data-register_action="community_reply" href="https://itch.io/login?return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fessssam.i